{"id":"ca49afa2dba90443","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-expression.md","title":"Expression","display":"df-expression — Expression","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-expression","aliases":["67-df-expression"],"display":"df-expression — Expression","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-syntax-interface]]"],"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_scope":"本册形式语言接口；原书第1章pp.5–10，PDF16–21的记号对应，不声称逐字定义","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-checked","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-expression"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-expression</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-expression — Expression"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"本册形式语言接口；原书第1章pp.5–10，PDF16–21的记号对应，不声称逐字定义"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a>。表达式载体是项、公式和有限公式列的带标签不交并。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{in}_{0,L},\\mathrm{in}_{1,L},\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}\">\\(\\mathrm{in}_{0,L},\\mathrm{in}_{1,L},\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}\\)</span> 是下式定义的类型嵌入；在 Gödel 编号中按参数类型省略这些嵌入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Expr}_L=\\operatorname{Expr}(L)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_L)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_L)\\cup(\\{2\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{&lt;\\omega}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{in}_{0,L}(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,t\\rangle,&amp;\\mathrm{in}_{1,L}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\varphi\\rangle,&amp;\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,s\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Expr}_L=\\operatorname{Expr}(L)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_L)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_L)\\cup(\\{2\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{&lt;\\omega}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{in}_{0,L}(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,t\\rangle,&amp;\\mathrm{in}_{1,L}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\varphi\\rangle,&amp;\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,s\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书 pp.9–10 对公式及证明等形式对象统一编号。本册选用显式类型标记，避免项、公式和证明序列发生载体混同。旧式 Expr=Fml∪Term 没有覆盖上游证明编号所用的有限公式序列，且混接了第57册的完整原始联结词语法与第88/90册的较小原始语法；现统一使用本册 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a> 已形式定义的接口。这是本册具体实现选择，不宣称原书使用相同三元标签。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为签名，$\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L$ 取 [[67-df-formula]]。表达式载体是项、公式和有限公式列的带标签不交并。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 pp.9–10 对公式及证明等形式对象统一编号。本册选用显式类型标记，避免项、公式和证明序列发生载体混同。旧式 Expr=Fml∪Term 没有覆盖上游证明编号所用的有限公式序列，且混接了第57册的完整原始联结词语法与第88/90册的较小原始语法；现统一使用本册 [[67-df-formula]] 已形式定义的接口。这是本册具体实现选择，不宣称原书使用相同三元标签。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{in}_{0,L},\\mathrm{in}_{1,L},\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Expr}_L=\\operatorname{Expr}(L)&\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_L)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_L)\\cup(\\{2\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{<\\omega}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{in}_{0,L}(t)&\\coloneqq\\langle0,t\\rangle,&\\mathrm{in}_{1,L}(\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\varphi\\rangle,&\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}(s)&\\coloneqq\\langle2,s\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2177,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L$ 是固定有效有限字母表语言，$\\mathrm{Expr}_L$、公式及项见 [[67-df-expression]]。固定 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的符号编号及有限树编码 $c_L$，下式取 $c=c_L$；$c[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]$ 是递归集合。"},{"id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc}$ 取 [[67-df-sequence]]；$\\mathrm{in}_{0,L},\\mathrm{in}_{1,L},\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}$ 是 [[67-df-expression]] 的项、公式、有限公式列标签嵌入。$c_L$ 由下式按树递归给出。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-expression]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-expression]]"}],"outgoing":["2035a1f4d72e7df9","3f06c9fe86c236dd"]}